ead","Cardiac Unit Coordinator"]},{"type":"h","text":"Cath-Lab Path"},{"type":"flow","items":["Cardiac Technologist","Cath-Lab Experience","Senior Cath-Lab Technologist","Specialized Interventional Cardiology Technologist","Cath-Lab Technical Coordinator"]},{"type":"h","text":"Medical-Device Path"},{"type":"flow","items":["Cardiac Technologist","Clinical Applications Trainee","Cardiac Applications Specialist","Senior Applications Specialist","Product Manager","Cardiovascular Technology Consultant"]},{"type":"h","text":"Emerging Technologies"},{"type":"p","text":"The cardiac-care technology field is rapidly evolving toward:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"AI-assisted ECG"},{"text":"Wearable ECG"},{"text":"Remote cardiac monitoring"},{"text":"Implantable cardiac-device monitoring"},{"text":"Digital biomarkers"},{"text":"AI-assisted cardiac imaging"},{"text":"3D cardiac visualization"},{"text":"Robotic catheterization"},{"text":"Advanced electrophysiology mapping"},{"text":"Connected patient-monitoring systems"},{"text":"Predictive cardiac analytics"}]},{"type":"p","text":"A strong future profile will combine:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Cardiovascular Technology","ECG","Critical Care","Cath Lab","Digital Cardiology","AI/Data Literacy"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Recommended Final Skill Stack"},{"type":"p","text":"CARDIAC CARE TECHNOLOGIST"},{"type":"p","text":"│"},{"type":"p","text":"├── Cardiovascular Science"},{"type":"p","text":"│ ├── Cardiac Anatomy"},{"type":"p","text":"│ ├── Physiology"},{"type":"p","text":"│ ├── Pathology"},{"type":"p","text":"│ └── Pharmacology Fundamentals"},{"type":"p","text":"│"},{"type":"p","text":"├── Cardiac Diagnostics"},{"type":"p","text":"│ ├── ECG"},{"type":"p","text":"│ ├── Holter"},{"type":"p","text":"│ ├── Stress Testing"},{"type":"p","text":"│ └── Cardiac Monitoring"},{"type":"p","text":"│"},{"type":"p","text":"├── Procedures"},{"type":"p","text":"│ ├── Cath Lab"},{"type":"p","text":"│ ├── Hemodynamics"},{"type":"p","text":"│ ├── EP Lab"},{"type":"p","text":"│ └── Sterile Technique"},{"type":"p","text":"│"},{"type":"p","text":"├── Critical Care"},{"type":"p","text":"│ ├── ICCU/CCU"},{"type":"p","text":"│ ├── BLS/CPR"},{"type":"p","text":"│ ├── Emergency Response"},{"type":"p","text":"│ └── Patient Monitoring"},{"type":"p","text":"│"},{"type":"p","text":"├── Technology"},{"type":"p","text":"│ ├── Digital ECG"},{"type":"p","text":"│ ├── PACS/DICOM"},{"type":"p","text":"│ ├── Wearables"},{"type":"p","text":"│ └── AI-Assisted Cardiology"},{"type":"p","text":"│"},{"type":"p","text":"└── Professional"},{"type":"p","text":"├── Documentation"},{"type":"p","text":"├── Quality Management"},{"type":"p","text":"├── Patient Safety"},{"type":"p","text":"└── Multidisciplinary Teamwork"},{"type":"h","text":"Target Profile by Graduation"},{"type":"p","text":"By graduation, the student should have:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Strong cardiovascular anatomy and physiology"},{"text":"ECG acquisition and interpretation fundamentals"},{"text":"Cardiac-monitoring skills"},{"text":"Holter and stress-test workflow knowledge"},{"text":"Cath-lab exposure"},{"text":"Hemodynamic-monitoring fundamentals"},{"text":"Electrophysiology awareness"},{"text":"ICCU/CCU exposure"},{"text":"BLS/CPR competency"},{"text":"Sterile-technique knowledge"},{"text":"Cardiac-equipment handling skills"},{"text":"Patient-safety awareness"},{"text":"PACS/DICOM and digital-cardiology familiarity"},{"text":"Basic Excel/data-analysis skills"},{"text":"AI-assisted cardiac technology awareness"},{"text":"Significant supervised clinical training"},{"text":"At least one cardiovascular technology project"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Best Overall Positioning"},{"type":"flow","items":["Cardiovascular Technology Degree","ECG & Cardiac Monitoring","Cath-Lab/ICCU Clinical Training","Specialized Cardiac Technology","Senior Cardiac Care Technologist","Cath-Lab/EP Technical Lead / Cardiac Technology Specialist"]},{"type":"note","label":"Database mapping note","text":"Cardiac Care / Cardiovascular Technology → Cardiac Care Technologist is a strong direct mapping. For greater precision in the database, this specialization can later branch into ECG Technologist, Cath-Lab Technologist, Electrophysiology Technologist, Cardiac Monitoring Technologist, and Cardiovascular Applications Specialist."}]}]}